ilobytes_per_second}} KBps","在你安装目录下的文件权限正在阻止《英雄联盟》的安装。请按“OK”键，然后我们将尝试唤起你的操作系统的权限管理器。":"The file permissions in your installation directory are preventing League from installing. Please press 'Okay' and we will attempt prompt your operating system's permissions' manager.","在连接至服务器时出问题了。请检查你的网络连接并重启补丁器。如果你的网络连接没有问题，请联系客服进行处理。":" There is a problem connecting to the server. Please check your internet connection and restart the patcher. If your internet connectivity isn't the issue, please follow the connection troubleshooting steps on our <a href=\"https://support-leagueoflegends.riotgames.com/hc/articles/201752664\" target='_blank'>support page</a> to find possible solutions.","补丁器无法下载内容至你的硬盘。请检查下你的电脑，至少需要8GB的空闲容量和写入硬盘的必要权限才能安装《英雄联盟》。你可以联系我们的客服来获取更多有关这个错误的帮助。*注意*：点击“是”将关闭客户端。":"A patch was unable to download to your hard drive. This error is usually caused by not having enough room on your disk for the download. Please ensure that your computer has at least 8 GB of free space on the drive where League is installed and that you have the necessary permissions to write to the drive. For more help with this error, see the troubleshooting steps <a href=\"https://support-leagueoflegends.riotgames.com/hc/articles/202969434\" target='_blank'>here</a>. Note: Clicking \"Okay\" will close the client.","我们的服务器出故障了，并且在阻止你下载补丁内容。我们正在给服务器另一次机会。你可以<a href=\"http://lol.qq.com/act/a20150326dqpd/\" target='_blank'>点此</a>查看我们的服务器状态。":"Something's up with our servers and it's preventing you from patching. We're giving it another shot. In the meantime, you can check the status of our servers <a href=\"http://status.leagueoflegends.com\" target='_blank'>here</a>.","《英雄联盟》无法更新，因为你没有足够的硬盘空间。请至少释放{{Bytes}}空间然后重试。":"League can't update because you don't have enough disk space. Please free up at least {{Bytes}} of space and try again.","补丁更新失败，并且我们不确定原因是什么。请重启客户端并重试补丁更新。":"Patching failed and we're not sure why. Please restart the client to try patching again.","预计用时 {{number}}分钟":"ETA {{number}} mins","好":"Okay","文件无法写入硬盘。请检查你是否有足够的磁盘空间和必要的许可。":"Failed to write file to disk. Please check that you have enough free space and that you have the necessary permissions.","已修复档案：{{number}}":"Files repaired: {{number}}","已扫描的文件：{{number}}":"Files scanned: {{number}}","联盟客户端":"LEAGUE CLIENT","游戏客户端":"GAME CLIENT","我们的服务器发生了些状况，导致你无法从服务器中获得更新文件。我们正在对服务器进行停机维护。在维护时，你可以在这里查看我们的服务器状态。":"Something's up with our servers, and it's preventing you from patching. We're giving it another shot. In the meantime, check the status of our servers here","这个错误也许由以下现网内部事故导致：":"These live incidents may have caused the error:","我们已经将这个安装程序恢复至一个较早的《英雄联盟》版本、现在我们将尝试将它更新至最新版本。":"We have restored this installation to an older version of League of Legends. Now we'll try to patch it up to the latest version.","正在应用版本补丁":"Applying Patches","正在下载文件":"Dowloading Files","正在提取所需的版本数据":"Fetching Required Patch Data","正在安装":"INSTALLING","正在下载":"DOWNLOADING","正在修复":"REPAIRING","正在扫描":"SCANNING","修复":"Repair","抱歉！我们在你的安装过程中检测到一些数据损坏。你想要修复受损的文件么？":"Sorry! We've detected some possible data corruption in your installation. Would you like to repair the affected files?","更新已完成下载。你必须重启客户端才能让更新生效。":"An update has finished downloading. You must restart League of Legends before the update can be applied.","现在还不行":"Not Now","重新启动":"Restart","第{{current_step}}步（共{{total_steps}}步）":"Step {{current_step}} of {{total_steps}}","更新失败，而我们不确定是什么原因。点击我们的客服页面{{support page}}来查找可能的解决方法。":"Patching failed, but we're not sure why. Check our support page {{support page}} to find possible solutions.","正在更新……":"Updating...","在更新《英雄联盟》时出现了一个问题。我们正在复原《英雄联盟》的备份版本，并会在你重新启动后再次尝试":"There was a problem updating League of Legends. We'll restore a backup version of League and try again after you restart","游戏仍在进行中…":"Game is still in progress...","全随机":"ALL RANDOM","跳过等待，直接开始下一局游戏。":"Skip waiting for stats","开始游戏":"Start Game","可用":"Available","剩余1日":"1 day left","剩余{{days}}天":"{{days}} days left","金币加成":"IP BOOST","网吧特权加成":"Loyalty Bo