our champion can move through units and has 27% increased Movement Speed for 10 seconds.","治疗术":"Heal","为你和目标友军英雄回复95-345（取决于英雄等级）生命值，并为你和目标友军英雄提供30%移动速度加成，持续1秒。若目标近期已受到过其它治疗术的影响，则治疗术对目标产生的治疗效果减半。":"Restores 90-345 Health (depending on champion level) and grants 30% Movement Speed for 1 second to you and target allied champion. This healing is halved for units recently affected by Summoner Heal.","引燃":"Ignite","引燃是对单体敌方目标施放的持续性伤害技能，在5秒的持续时间里造成70-410（取决于英雄等级）真实伤害，获得目标的视野，并减少目标所受的治疗和回复效果。":"Ignites target enemy champion, dealing 70-410 true damage (depending on champion level) over 5 seconds, grants you vision of the target, and reduces healing effects on them for the duration.","标记":"Mark","沿直线扔出一个雪球。如果雪球命中了一个敌人，那么这个敌人会被【标记】，并且你的英雄接下来可以快速突进到被【标记】的目标旁边。":"Throw a snowball in a straight line at your enemies. If it hits an enemy, they become marked and your champion can quickly travel to the marked target as a follow up.","魄罗投掷":"Poro Toss","把一个魄罗投向你的敌人。如果它命中了一名敌人，那么你接下来就可以快速位移到被命中的敌人旁边。":"Throw a Poro at your enemies. If it hits, you can quickly travel to your target as a follow up.","重生":"Revive","立刻在本队的召唤师平台上复活你的英雄，并暂时提升英雄的移动速度。":"Instantly revives your champion at your team's Summoner Platform and increases their Movement Speed for a short duration.","惩戒":"Smite","对目标史诗野怪、大型野怪或敌方小兵造成390-1000（取决于英雄等级）点真实伤害。":"Deals 390-1000 true damage (depending on champion level) to target epic or large monster or enemy minion.","传送":"Teleport","在引导3.5秒后，将英雄传送到目标友方建筑物、小兵或守卫旁边。":"After channeling for 3.5 seconds, teleports your champion to target allied structure, minion, or ward.","护驾！":"To the King!","快速位移到魄罗之王旁边。":"Quickly travel to the Poro King's side.","立刻领取":"INSTANT","免费":"FREE","设置数量":"Set Quantity","你没有足够的代币。":"You don't have enough tokens","输入至少{{minQuantity}}个。":"Enter at least {{minQuantity}}","你只能以{{minQuantity}}的倍数来购买。":"You can only buy mutliples of {{minQuantity}}","愚人节快乐，乐子人们！来庆祝一下吧！ ":"Happy April Fools', merrymaker! Let us celebrate!","愚人节大军需要增援，而你就是那个完美的呆萌士兵！":"